      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TheirStack Discovery (weekly)\nSources hiring signals -> companies + job_postings + ats_registry.\nATS slug extracted best-effort (~11-13% of results in testing, see project memory) -\nthis is a real ceiling from job-market data distribution, not an extraction bug.\nScoring/signals (stale_posting, multi_role, lone_engineer, contract_language) are\ncomputed by a separate downstream Scoring workflow, not here.",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
